1
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Silent Storm]</font>

2
00:01:34,160 --> 00:01:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[1994, Chunjiang City]</font>

3
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Amarilli, my sweetheart♪</font>

4
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:54,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Please believe♪</font>

5
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The sweet love in my heart♪</font>

6
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In 1994,</font>

7
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:24,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a turnover tax system centered on VAT</font>

8
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:26,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was formally established.</font>

9
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Special VAT invoices</font>

10
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:29,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are both commercial documents</font>

11
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:31,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and important tax documents.</font>

12
00:02:32,350 --> 00:02:35,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Their value draws criminals
like flies to carrion.</font>

13
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:37,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Resale, theft,</font>

14
00:02:37,950 --> 00:02:40,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Invoice Copy]
and forging of VAT invoices</font>

15
00:02:40,510 --> 00:02:41,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">keep proliferating.</font>

16
00:02:42,190 --> 00:02:44,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A forged VAT invoice book</font>

17
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">costs about 1 yuan</font>

18
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but can sell for 200 or 300.</font>

19
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's hundreds of times the cost,</font>

20
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:52,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">enough to make criminals
risk their lives.</font>

21
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:10,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Come out!
- Who are you?</font>

22
00:03:10,070 --> 00:03:11,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Come out!
- Do you know whose goods these are?</font>

23
00:03:11,750 --> 00:03:13,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd rob even us?</font>

24
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:16,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you people?</font>

25
00:03:16,670 --> 00:03:18,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You dare rob the Lins?</font>

26
00:03:28,350 --> 00:03:29,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's you Lins we're robbing!</font>

27
00:03:30,510 --> 00:03:31,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get them!</font>

28
00:04:19,790 --> 00:04:21,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong, we got the electrotype plate!</font>

29
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With a plate like this,</font>

30
00:04:23,350 --> 00:04:25,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can print the best invoices</font>

31
00:04:25,470 --> 00:04:26,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that are true to the original.</font>

32
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:33,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you hurt?</font>

33
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:36,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No. Only others get hurt.</font>

34
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:37,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be so arrogant.</font>

35
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:38,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sometimes, you have to endure.</font>

36
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:05,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 1]</font>

37
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:10,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chunjiang Department Store]</font>

38
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move! Move!</font>

39
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Price tag]</font>

40
00:05:25,230 --> 00:05:25,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

41
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these shoes are falling apart.</font>

42
00:05:28,470 --> 00:05:30,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to replace the whole sole.</font>

43
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:31,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much to replace the sole?</font>

44
00:05:31,990 --> 00:05:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ten yuan.</font>

45
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:35,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

46
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:37,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you just patch the cracked part,</font>

47
00:05:38,110 --> 00:05:38,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how much?</font>

48
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:39,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One yuan.</font>

49
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:40,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then patch it.</font>

50
00:05:40,990 --> 00:05:41,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

51
00:05:42,430 --> 00:05:43,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't replace this,</font>

52
00:05:44,350 --> 00:05:46,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll apply glue to fix it</font>

53
00:05:46,670 --> 00:05:48,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then nail it.</font>

54
00:05:48,790 --> 00:05:51,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After nailing,
it can easily poke your foot.</font>

55
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:53,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just patch it.</font>

56
00:05:55,640 --> 00:05:56,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are these shoes</font>

57
00:05:56,990 --> 00:05:58,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">worth more than your feet?</font>

58
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:00,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My wife bought them for me.</font>

59
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:01,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I see.</font>

60
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:03,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One yuan?</font>

61
00:06:03,350 --> 00:06:03,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, one yuan.</font>

62
00:06:04,310 --> 00:06:05,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Use more glue, sir.</font>

63
00:06:06,110 --> 00:06:06,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay.</font>

64
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:12,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Everyone will die♪</font>

65
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:16,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No need to make me explain♪</font>

66
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:20,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much for a basket of soup dumplings?</font>

67
00:06:20,790 --> 00:06:21,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two yuan.</font>

68
00:06:23,890 --> 00:06:25,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's be men of courage♪</font>

69
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:27,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Willing to venture into the world♪</font>

70
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch where you're driving!</font>

71
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:32,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, let him pass.</font>

72
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:32,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let him pass.</font>

73
00:06:34,220 --> 00:06:36,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With my true heart and sincerity♪</font>

74
00:06:36,610 --> 00:06:40,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Chasing ambitiously
in the competitive circle♪</font>

75
00:06:42,330 --> 00:06:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Life has special meanings♪</font>

76
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:57,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Robbery! Robbery!</font>

77
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:00,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Robbery!</font>

78
00:07:03,310 --> 00:07:04,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Robbery!</font>

79
00:07:05,230 --> 00:07:07,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Robbery! Robbery!</font>

80
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:15,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give it to me!</font>

81
00:07:16,230 --> 00:07:16,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give it to me!</font>

82
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't move!</font>

83
00:07:42,550 --> 00:07:43,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay?</font>

84
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:43,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine. My bag!</font>

85
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:44,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait for me here.</font>

86
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:47,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here come the biker robbers!</font>

87
00:08:00,550 --> 00:08:01,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

88
00:08:09,430 --> 00:08:10,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You jerk!</font>

89
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:12,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You knocked over my umbrella!</font>

90
00:08:12,520 --> 00:08:13,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you blind?</font>

91
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:16,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have to pay for it, you jerk!</font>

92
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

93
00:08:21,790 --> 00:08:22,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

94
00:08:37,310 --> 00:08:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You broke loser!</font>

95
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:39,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's nothing in the bag.</font>

96
00:08:39,910 --> 00:08:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you chasing me so hard?</font>

97
00:08:41,590 --> 00:08:43,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me back that notebook.
Keep the bag.</font>

98
00:08:44,190 --> 00:08:45,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you?</font>

99
00:08:45,710 --> 00:08:47,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Ouyang Xu
from the Tax Inspection Unit</font>

100
00:08:47,670 --> 00:08:48,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of Chunjiang City.</font>

101
00:08:50,190 --> 00:08:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're just a lackey,</font>

102
00:08:51,310 --> 00:08:52,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">chasing me all this way.</font>

103
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I come down, I'll arrest you first.</font>

104
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:55,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, come down.</font>

105
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:57,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's see you arrest me. Come down!</font>

106
00:08:58,240 --> 00:08:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You got bad breath? Why spray perfume?</font>

107
00:09:04,430 --> 00:09:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Come down!
- Come down!</font>

108
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, what's the matter?</font>

109
00:09:07,190 --> 00:09:08,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No guts?</font>

110
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:12,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough is enough.</font>

111
00:09:12,670 --> 00:09:13,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No more holding back.</font>

112
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Fight!
- Fight!</font>

113
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get them!</font>

114
00:09:34,520 --> 00:09:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Giving in?</font>

115
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If not, let's go again.</font>

116
00:09:46,430 --> 00:09:47,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

117
00:09:48,790 --> 00:09:49,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay?</font>

118
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:51,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All my bottles were stolen.</font>

119
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have to do something.</font>

120
00:09:52,670 --> 00:09:53,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't even handle this?</font>

121
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:54,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's been so many days.</font>

122
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The bottles I collected were stolen.</font>

123
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:58,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you going to do anything or not?</font>

124
00:09:58,830 --> 00:10:01,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, they all collect bottles.</font>

125
00:10:01,670 --> 00:10:02,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hard to say who stole from whom.</font>

126
00:10:02,950 --> 00:10:04,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just try to keep them safe.</font>

127
00:10:04,520 --> 00:10:05,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful, okay?</font>

128
00:10:05,710 --> 00:10:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't let anyone take them, alright?</font>

129
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, he's really anxious.</font>

130
00:10:10,880 --> 00:10:11,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty good fighter.</font>

131
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've had training, right?</font>

132
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get someone to help you soon, okay?</font>

133
00:10:13,910 --> 00:10:14,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How long will that take?</font>

134
00:10:14,670 --> 00:10:16,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very soon. Just wait a moment, okay?</font>

135
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, is this yours?</font>

136
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:24,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

137
00:10:24,760 --> 00:10:26,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry, it got dirty.</font>

138
00:10:26,830 --> 00:10:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

139
00:10:27,950 --> 00:10:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This...</font>

140
00:10:28,910 --> 00:10:29,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this medicine?</font>

141
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:31,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A life-saving one.</font>

142
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:37,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

143
00:10:42,070 --> 00:10:42,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Ouyang Xu.</font>

144
00:10:44,830 --> 00:10:45,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Zhou Haiyang.</font>

145
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really wasn't me.</font>

146
00:10:46,830 --> 00:10:47,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't try anything.</font>

147
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Officer, listen to me.
- Move!</font>

148
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officer,</font>

149
00:10:53,910 --> 00:10:55,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tax Inspection Certificate]
I'm from the Tax Inspection Unit.</font>

150
00:10:55,950 --> 00:10:56,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We filed a report.</font>

151
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please help us handle it.</font>

152
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:58,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a moment.</font>

153
00:10:58,670 --> 00:10:59,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me ask for you.</font>

154
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you a cop?</font>

155
00:11:01,310 --> 00:11:02,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am a cop.</font>

156
00:11:02,430 --> 00:11:03,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I'm not from this station.</font>

157
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:05,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not from this station?</font>

158
00:11:05,190 --> 00:11:06,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then why are you here?</font>

159
00:11:06,430 --> 00:11:07,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here on business.</font>

160
00:11:08,430 --> 00:11:10,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm begging you, officer.</font>

161
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong? What is it?</font>

162
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:13,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened?</font>

163
00:11:14,190 --> 00:11:15,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Get up.
- Get up first. Take your time.</font>

164
00:11:15,950 --> 00:11:16,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up.</font>

165
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Wait.
- I'm begging you.</font>

166
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you speak Mandarin?</font>

167
00:11:20,070 --> 00:11:20,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up first.</font>

168
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:21,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is she saying?</font>

169
00:11:22,670 --> 00:11:23,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't understand her either.</font>

170
00:11:23,310 --> 00:11:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't understand either?</font>

171
00:11:24,280 --> 00:11:24,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well.</font>

172
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:27,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ma'am, take your time.</font>

173
00:11:27,310 --> 00:11:28,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can understand you.</font>

174
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:28,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened?</font>

175
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:30,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The boss ran off.</font>

176
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:32,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A whole year's wages are gone.</font>

177
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:33,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All three of you got nothing?</font>

178
00:11:33,790 --> 00:11:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's true.</font>

179
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:38,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said the three of them worked here.</font>

180
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:40,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The boss didn't pay them for a year.</font>

181
00:11:40,310 --> 00:11:41,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then he took the money and ran.</font>

182
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

183
00:11:44,790 --> 00:11:45,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We will help you.</font>

184
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:47,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll resolve this, okay?</font>

185
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take this case first.</font>

186
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:50,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

187
00:11:50,310 --> 00:11:51,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen, sir.</font>

188
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:53,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you help translate?</font>

189
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:54,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's sit down first.</font>

190
00:11:54,190 --> 00:11:55,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You handle this.</font>

191
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:55,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay.</font>

192
00:11:55,910 --> 00:11:57,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take care of you, tax officer.</font>

193
00:11:57,310 --> 00:11:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Sit down.
- Come on.</font>

194
00:11:58,550 --> 00:11:59,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell us slowly what's going on.</font>

195
00:12:00,590 --> 00:12:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't get worked up.</font>

196
00:12:02,710 --> 00:12:04,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, could you translate?</font>

197
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:04,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay.</font>

198
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:06,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ma'am, tell me.</font>

199
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:07,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll tell the officer.</font>

200
00:12:07,830 --> 00:12:08,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She will help you.</font>

201
00:12:09,280 --> 00:12:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Inspection Unit of the Tax Bureau.</font>

202
00:12:12,070 --> 00:12:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know Zhang Haiyuan, the Chief?</font>

203
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:15,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

204
00:12:15,950 --> 00:12:16,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's my master.</font>

205
00:12:17,310 --> 00:12:18,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No wonder.</font>

206
00:12:18,520 --> 00:12:20,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two against six biker robbers.</font>

207
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:21,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty good fighters.</font>

208
00:12:22,550 --> 00:12:23,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang Xu.</font>

209
00:12:24,880 --> 00:12:27,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Yan Ping'an
from the city criminal police.</font>

210
00:12:30,710 --> 00:12:31,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're a CID officer?</font>

211
00:12:32,710 --> 00:12:34,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to be a CID officer
before I joined tax.</font>

212
00:12:35,950 --> 00:12:36,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you still hiring?</font>

213
00:12:37,190 --> 00:12:38,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Recruit me.</font>

214
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:40,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't think our job is that simple.</font>

215
00:12:40,430 --> 00:12:42,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What you did today</font>

216
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:44,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is half credit, half fault at best.</font>

217
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:46,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, police and tax</font>

218
00:12:46,710 --> 00:12:48,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">had a joint street patrol operation.</font>

219
00:12:48,190 --> 00:12:49,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you join?</font>

220
00:12:49,590 --> 00:12:50,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was going to.</font>

221
00:12:51,070 --> 00:12:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I ran into a special situation.</font>

222
00:12:53,280 --> 00:12:54,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you ran into this,</font>

223
00:12:55,160 --> 00:12:55,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would you ignore it?</font>

224
00:12:56,160 --> 00:12:57,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd handle it. But I have to remind you:</font>

225
00:12:58,190 --> 00:12:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Risking one's life to catch criminals</font>

226
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:01,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the police's job.</font>

227
00:13:01,710 --> 00:13:04,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You tax people levy and collect taxes,</font>

228
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and guard the nation's purse.</font>

229
00:13:05,910 --> 00:13:06,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Each has their own duty.</font>

230
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're only half right.</font>

231
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:10,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We not only have to manage</font>

232
00:13:10,830 --> 00:13:11,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the nation's purse.</font>

233
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:13,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since we collect the taxes</font>

234
00:13:13,550 --> 00:13:14,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from the people,</font>

235
00:13:14,790 --> 00:13:15,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we must use them for the people.</font>

236
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:16,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, right.</font>

237
00:13:17,040 --> 00:13:18,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Including our police salaries.</font>

238
00:13:18,710 --> 00:13:20,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, the biker robbers are so rampant.</font>

239
00:13:20,710 --> 00:13:22,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They slashed people
when they failed at robbery</font>

240
00:13:22,430 --> 00:13:23,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right outside your police station.</font>

241
00:13:24,790 --> 00:13:27,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think you police
should crack down hard.</font>

242
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:29,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, you're right to criticize.</font>

243
00:13:30,590 --> 00:13:31,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next,</font>

244
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:32,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll target these biker robbers</font>

245
00:13:32,790 --> 00:13:34,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with a special crackdown operation.</font>

246
00:13:34,310 --> 00:13:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just wait and see.</font>

247
00:13:37,430 --> 00:13:38,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, that's about it for today.</font>

248
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:39,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you have something to do,</font>

249
00:13:40,790 --> 00:13:41,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can leave first.</font>

250
00:13:41,670 --> 00:13:43,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, put your fingerprint here.</font>

251
00:13:43,790 --> 00:13:44,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He has to stay a bit longer.</font>

252
00:13:46,190 --> 00:13:46,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here?</font>

253
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:47,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

254
00:13:49,950 --> 00:13:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that okay?</font>

255
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:51,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good.</font>

256
00:13:51,190 --> 00:13:52,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll pass it on to the comrades
at the station.</font>

257
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:53,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good.</font>

258
00:14:02,880 --> 00:14:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me give this to him.</font>

259
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:05,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He must have run into some trouble.</font>

260
00:14:05,590 --> 00:14:07,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's flat broke. I'm helping him out.</font>

261
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:11,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

262
00:14:11,520 --> 00:14:12,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

263
00:14:16,070 --> 00:14:16,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move it.</font>

264
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:18,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Behave.</font>

265
00:14:19,190 --> 00:14:20,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you arresting me?</font>

266
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't do anything wrong!</font>

267
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:22,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cut the crap. Move it.</font>

268
00:14:23,070 --> 00:14:24,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up. Move, move.</font>

269
00:14:27,550 --> 00:14:28,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey.</font>

270
00:14:30,310 --> 00:14:31,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's all wrapped up inside?</font>

271
00:14:31,710 --> 00:14:32,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

272
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for interpreting on behalf</font>

273
00:14:36,190 --> 00:14:37,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of the comrades at the station.</font>

274
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:38,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was no trouble.</font>

275
00:14:40,400 --> 00:14:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's the guy who was with you?</font>

276
00:14:41,240 --> 00:14:42,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The one from the Tax Bureau.</font>

277
00:14:42,710 --> 00:14:43,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He had something urgent and left.</font>

278
00:14:44,190 --> 00:14:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You needed him for something?</font>

279
00:14:45,160 --> 00:14:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just wanted to thank him.</font>

280
00:14:48,280 --> 00:14:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm curious.</font>

281
00:14:49,160 --> 00:14:51,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your statement says you're not a local.</font>

282
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:54,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you caught up to them
through a shortcut.</font>

283
00:14:54,670 --> 00:14:56,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are you so familiar with Chunjiang?</font>

284
00:15:00,310 --> 00:15:01,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Relax, relax.</font>

285
00:15:02,160 --> 00:15:03,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just asking.</font>

286
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:06,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since I came to Chunjiang,</font>

287
00:15:07,310 --> 00:15:09,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been walking around a lot.</font>

288
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:11,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I remember every road I've walked.</font>

289
00:15:11,430 --> 00:15:12,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Walking around, looking for work?</font>

290
00:15:15,070 --> 00:15:15,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't tell me?</font>

291
00:15:21,110 --> 00:15:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪My lovely Amarilli♪</font>

292
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm looking for my wife.</font>

293
00:15:37,830 --> 00:15:38,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looking for your wife?</font>

294
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:42,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did she get lost or go missing?</font>

295
00:15:42,280 --> 00:15:43,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you file a report?</font>

296
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:46,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A couple of days ago,</font>

297
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:47,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to the police station.</font>

298
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:50,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They said my wife</font>

299
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:52,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doesn't count as a missing person,</font>

300
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so no case was filed.</font>

301
00:15:56,430 --> 00:15:56,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's what you do.</font>

302
00:15:57,280 --> 00:15:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Write down</font>

303
00:15:58,550 --> 00:15:59,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your wife's name</font>

304
00:15:59,710 --> 00:16:00,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and ID number.</font>

305
00:16:03,280 --> 00:16:04,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She... You've got it wrong.</font>

306
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:05,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My wife hasn't committed any crime.</font>

307
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:06,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's a good person.</font>

308
00:16:06,830 --> 00:16:07,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got it wrong.</font>

309
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:10,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll look into it when I'm free. Write.</font>

310
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:23,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it.</font>

311
00:16:25,950 --> 00:16:26,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no, I don't need it.</font>

312
00:16:27,120 --> 00:16:27,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it.</font>

313
00:16:27,710 --> 00:16:28,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really don't need it. Thanks.</font>

314
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:30,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You qualify for assistance.</font>

315
00:16:32,280 --> 00:16:32,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, write.</font>

316
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:36,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look, is it okay written like this?</font>

317
00:16:38,310 --> 00:16:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Xiaohong?</font>

318
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:42,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

319
00:16:43,040 --> 00:16:44,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If there's news about her,</font>

320
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:45,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how do I find you?</font>

321
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:47,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't need to find me.</font>

322
00:16:47,790 --> 00:16:48,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can find you.</font>

323
00:16:50,670 --> 00:16:51,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- You can leave now.
- Okay.</font>

324
00:16:51,640 --> 00:16:52,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Zhou Haiyang.</font>

325
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:54,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know.</font>

326
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:55,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How should I address you?</font>

327
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:56,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Yan Ping'an.</font>

328
00:16:58,160 --> 00:16:58,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yan.</font>

329
00:16:58,950 --> 00:17:02,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every revolutionary soldier
must remember</font>

330
00:17:02,550 --> 00:17:05,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Three Main Rules of Discipline
and Eight Points for Attention.</font>

331
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:09,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First, obey orders in all our actions.</font>

332
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:12,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only with unified steps
can we win victory.</font>

333
00:17:13,110 --> 00:17:16,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Second, don't take anything
from the masses.</font>

334
00:17:16,630 --> 00:17:19,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The masses support and like us.</font>

335
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:24,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You sure love a good spectacle, huh?</font>

336
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:26,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you all:</font>

337
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:27,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whoever fails to follow orders</font>

338
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:28,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while on the job</font>

339
00:17:29,150 --> 00:17:30,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will end up just like him.</font>

340
00:17:30,390 --> 00:17:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll be next.</font>

341
00:17:32,040 --> 00:17:32,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you hear that?</font>

342
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:33,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Yes.
- Understood, Master.</font>

343
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get back to work.</font>

344
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:40,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

345
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've finished singing it twenty times.</font>

346
00:17:47,830 --> 00:17:48,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen up.</font>

347
00:17:49,070 --> 00:17:49,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Attention.</font>

348
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:52,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me say something.</font>

349
00:17:54,630 --> 00:17:55,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong with you?</font>

350
00:17:56,280 --> 00:17:58,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you come from a military family.</font>

351
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone like you</font>

352
00:17:59,590 --> 00:18:01,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would cost us the fight
on the battlefield.</font>

353
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could have you shot,
believe it or not.</font>

354
00:18:02,630 --> 00:18:03,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That doesn't count.</font>

355
00:18:04,040 --> 00:18:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On my way to the battlefield,</font>

356
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I ran into another enemy unit,</font>

357
00:18:06,110 --> 00:18:07,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I blocked them on the spot.</font>

358
00:18:07,280 --> 00:18:08,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's adapting to the situation.</font>

359
00:18:08,350 --> 00:18:08,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Say that again?</font>

360
00:18:09,590 --> 00:18:10,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get down here.</font>

361
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:14,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I'm speaking,</font>

362
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:15,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't you talk back to me.</font>

363
00:18:15,150 --> 00:18:16,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I'll kick you, believe it or not.
- Master.</font>

364
00:18:16,630 --> 00:18:17,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Punishment or a beating, not both.</font>

365
00:18:17,630 --> 00:18:18,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the rule you set.</font>

366
00:18:19,590 --> 00:18:20,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think I don't know</font>

367
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:21,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your little scheme?</font>

368
00:18:21,790 --> 00:18:23,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just want to be a cop, right?</font>

369
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:24,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

370
00:18:24,520 --> 00:18:26,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First, do your job</font>

371
00:18:26,150 --> 00:18:27,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">properly and honestly.</font>

372
00:18:27,110 --> 00:18:27,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

373
00:18:29,110 --> 00:18:29,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can even bleed</font>

374
00:18:29,790 --> 00:18:31,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for tax work.</font>

375
00:18:34,550 --> 00:18:35,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does your wound still hurt?</font>

376
00:18:35,790 --> 00:18:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine, Master.</font>

377
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stand straight.</font>

378
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:40,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no master here, only a chief.</font>

379
00:18:42,110 --> 00:18:43,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today's joint street patrol operation</font>

380
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:44,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has been very effective.</font>

381
00:18:45,630 --> 00:18:47,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We already have intel</font>

382
00:18:47,350 --> 00:18:48,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on the counterfeit invoice den</font>

383
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:49,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that we've been tracking.</font>

384
00:18:50,110 --> 00:18:51,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There might be an operation tonight.</font>

385
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't mess up on me again.</font>

386
00:18:54,040 --> 00:18:54,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

387
00:18:54,520 --> 00:18:55,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do a good job.</font>

388
00:18:56,240 --> 00:18:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise,
you'll surely receive punishment.</font>

389
00:18:58,070 --> 00:18:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

390
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink some water.</font>

391
00:19:02,280 --> 00:19:03,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm dying of thirst.</font>

392
00:19:05,040 --> 00:19:06,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- There's blood.
- It's nothing.</font>

393
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

394
00:19:07,440 --> 00:19:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me have some water.</font>

395
00:19:08,870 --> 00:19:10,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm dying of thirst.
I sang it twenty times.</font>

396
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink up, drink up.</font>

397
00:19:11,240 --> 00:19:12,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My throat is...</font>

398
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jia-Xu Ancestral Ceremony
of the Lin Clan]</font>

399
00:19:19,560 --> 00:19:20,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

400
00:19:20,830 --> 00:19:21,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

401
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The light bulbs need to be symmetrical.</font>

402
00:19:26,110 --> 00:19:27,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The arrangement needs to be neat.</font>

403
00:19:28,280 --> 00:19:29,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Check if they light up</font>

404
00:19:30,310 --> 00:19:31,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and if they work.</font>

405
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:34,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, it'll be bad luck tonight.</font>

406
00:19:34,390 --> 00:19:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

407
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:35,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you hear me?</font>

408
00:19:35,760 --> 00:19:36,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

409
00:19:38,830 --> 00:19:39,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

410
00:19:39,790 --> 00:19:40,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go check it out.</font>

411
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:46,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Granduncle,</font>

412
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:48,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's about to rain. Go back inside.</font>

413
00:19:50,150 --> 00:19:51,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yuxian,</font>

414
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our family's ancestral legacy</font>

415
00:19:53,830 --> 00:19:55,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will be handed to you sooner or later.</font>

416
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:56,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The future ancestral rites</font>

417
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:58,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will be entrusted to you.</font>

418
00:20:20,760 --> 00:20:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Invoice Copy]</font>

419
00:20:26,280 --> 00:20:28,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've contacted Lin Jianye, Ahong.</font>

420
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:30,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said the paper issue with the invoice</font>

421
00:20:30,870 --> 00:20:31,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can be solved,</font>

422
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:33,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he's willing to meet you.</font>

423
00:20:33,630 --> 00:20:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But it must be in Linjia Village.</font>

424
00:20:49,760 --> 00:20:50,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll meet him.</font>

425
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:52,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, we'll meet him.</font>

426
00:20:53,350 --> 00:20:53,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

427
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:56,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we just got
Second Granduncle's electrotype plate.</font>

428
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid we might not come back.</font>

429
00:21:02,590 --> 00:21:04,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about we bring more people?</font>

430
00:21:06,790 --> 00:21:07,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just you and me.</font>

431
00:21:08,310 --> 00:21:10,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm the eldest daughter-in-law
of the Lin family.</font>

432
00:21:10,630 --> 00:21:12,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I don't even dare to return
to the village,</font>

433
00:21:13,200 --> 00:21:14,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who would still trust me?</font>

434
00:21:19,790 --> 00:21:21,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take these worthless papers back</font>

435
00:21:22,280 --> 00:21:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and find out who made them.</font>

436
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:25,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make him eat them.</font>

437
00:22:00,110 --> 00:22:00,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, attention.</font>

438
00:22:01,280 --> 00:22:01,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At ease.</font>

439
00:22:02,830 --> 00:22:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Attention.</font>

440
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:06,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, in recent days</font>

441
00:22:06,520 --> 00:22:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there have been frequent biker robberies</font>

442
00:22:08,240 --> 00:22:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in our province,</font>

443
00:22:10,550 --> 00:22:11,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">causing great panic</font>

444
00:22:11,830 --> 00:22:13,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">among our citizens</font>

445
00:22:13,760 --> 00:22:16,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and an extremely bad impact countrywide.</font>

446
00:22:17,240 --> 00:22:18,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just today,</font>

447
00:22:18,590 --> 00:22:20,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a biker robbery actually happened</font>

448
00:22:20,480 --> 00:22:22,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right in front of the police station.</font>

449
00:22:22,870 --> 00:22:24,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is an open provocation against us.</font>

450
00:22:25,200 --> 00:22:26,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must crack down severely.</font>

451
00:22:27,480 --> 00:22:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Under the deployment
of the provincial department,</font>

452
00:22:29,480 --> 00:22:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the province-wide
joint special crackdown operation</font>

453
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:32,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has officially begun.</font>

454
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our city cannot fall behind.</font>

455
00:22:35,070 --> 00:22:37,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must show no tolerance
for such vicious cases</font>

456
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:39,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and no mercy for criminals.</font>

457
00:22:40,240 --> 00:22:41,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you encounter violent resistance,</font>

458
00:22:42,350 --> 00:22:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you may use weapons
according to the law.</font>

459
00:22:44,680 --> 00:22:45,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that clear?</font>

460
00:22:45,870 --> 00:22:46,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

461
00:22:46,790 --> 00:22:47,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that clear?</font>

462
00:22:47,790 --> 00:22:48,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes!</font>

463
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:49,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yan Ping'an.</font>

464
00:22:49,630 --> 00:22:50,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here!</font>

465
00:22:50,440 --> 00:22:51,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your team stays behind.</font>

466
00:22:51,390 --> 00:22:53,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone else, move out immediately.</font>

467
00:22:53,350 --> 00:22:54,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

468
00:23:04,310 --> 00:23:04,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yan Ping'an.</font>

469
00:23:05,070 --> 00:23:05,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here!</font>

470
00:23:05,870 --> 00:23:07,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tonight, the procuratorate wants us</font>

471
00:23:07,760 --> 00:23:09,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to catch an invoice dealer</font>

472
00:23:09,550 --> 00:23:12,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in Linjia Village, Yuman Town,
with the Tax Bureau.</font>

473
00:23:12,830 --> 00:23:14,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your team will take this mission.</font>

474
00:23:15,440 --> 00:23:16,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

475
00:23:16,870 --> 00:23:17,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we won't take part</font>

476
00:23:17,920 --> 00:23:19,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the anti-biker-robber operation?</font>

477
00:23:19,040 --> 00:23:20,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did I not make myself clear?</font>

478
00:23:20,110 --> 00:23:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're both missions.</font>

479
00:23:20,960 --> 00:23:22,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop being so picky.</font>

480
00:23:22,350 --> 00:23:22,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

481
00:23:22,920 --> 00:23:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll lead this operation.</font>

482
00:23:24,110 --> 00:23:25,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's your first joint enforcement
with the Tax Bureau.</font>

483
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:26,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cooperation matters.</font>

484
00:23:26,920 --> 00:23:27,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

485
00:23:28,110 --> 00:23:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do we get guns?</font>

486
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can carry one.</font>

487
00:23:30,870 --> 00:23:31,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

488
00:23:36,150 --> 00:23:38,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As you said,</font>

489
00:23:38,630 --> 00:23:39,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the stronger one takes business.</font>

490
00:23:39,590 --> 00:23:40,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was it you?</font>

491
00:23:41,040 --> 00:23:42,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. I took the electroplate.</font>

492
00:23:44,070 --> 00:23:44,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

493
00:23:45,240 --> 00:23:47,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your share will only be more,
never less.</font>

494
00:23:48,150 --> 00:23:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want to take back
what the Lins owe me.</font>

495
00:23:55,280 --> 00:23:57,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our trip this time is really gambling
with our lives.</font>

496
00:23:58,350 --> 00:23:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sometimes, I really admire you.</font>

497
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You even dare to walk into a trap.</font>

498
00:24:02,280 --> 00:24:03,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rushing to your death?</font>

499
00:24:31,830 --> 00:24:32,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officer Yan,</font>

500
00:24:33,350 --> 00:24:34,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Han Lei from the city procuratorate.</font>

501
00:24:34,480 --> 00:24:35,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Hello.
- These two are Ouyang Xu and Wang Zhou</font>

502
00:24:35,590 --> 00:24:36,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from the Tax Bureau.</font>

503
00:24:37,150 --> 00:24:37,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

504
00:24:37,350 --> 00:24:39,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Comrade Yan Ping'an,</font>

505
00:24:39,070 --> 00:24:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- leader of our operation.
- Hello.</font>

506
00:24:40,280 --> 00:24:41,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're from the city criminal police.</font>

507
00:24:41,590 --> 00:24:43,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Zhang Chunlai,
director of the town police station.</font>

508
00:24:44,390 --> 00:24:45,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, I'll brief the deployment.</font>

509
00:24:46,110 --> 00:24:46,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We plan to enter from the east</font>

510
00:24:47,110 --> 00:24:48,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and west ends of the village
to make the arrest.</font>

511
00:24:54,830 --> 00:24:55,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's it?</font>

512
00:24:55,550 --> 00:24:56,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

513
00:24:58,040 --> 00:24:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about us?</font>

514
00:24:59,350 --> 00:25:01,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You and the procuratorate comrades</font>

515
00:25:01,200 --> 00:25:01,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">stand by here.</font>

516
00:25:02,760 --> 00:25:04,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't this a joint operation?</font>

517
00:25:04,550 --> 00:25:05,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, it is.</font>

518
00:25:05,550 --> 00:25:07,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But it involves arrests. It's dangerous.</font>

519
00:25:07,440 --> 00:25:08,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You knew it was dangerous,</font>

520
00:25:08,960 --> 00:25:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you only brought this many people?</font>

521
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:11,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're taking this way too lightly.</font>

522
00:25:11,110 --> 00:25:12,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're just catching an invoice dealer.</font>

523
00:25:12,630 --> 00:25:13,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I even brought my gun.</font>

524
00:25:13,590 --> 00:25:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't this many people enough?</font>

525
00:25:15,520 --> 00:25:17,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way. We have to be involved too.</font>

526
00:25:17,350 --> 00:25:17,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

527
00:25:18,720 --> 00:25:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your old habit of showing off</font>

528
00:25:19,480 --> 00:25:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is acting up again.</font>

529
00:25:21,720 --> 00:25:22,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This time is different.</font>

530
00:25:22,790 --> 00:25:24,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They don't just sell fake invoices;</font>

531
00:25:24,150 --> 00:25:25,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they also manufacture them.</font>

532
00:25:25,310 --> 00:25:26,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think our unit should lead</font>

533
00:25:26,310 --> 00:25:27,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this mission.</font>

534
00:25:28,680 --> 00:25:29,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, all right.</font>

535
00:25:29,870 --> 00:25:31,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here to coordinate your work.</font>

536
00:25:32,280 --> 00:25:33,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's my suggestion:</font>

537
00:25:33,680 --> 00:25:35,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since this is a joint operation,</font>

538
00:25:35,720 --> 00:25:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let the tax comrades</font>

539
00:25:36,960 --> 00:25:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">go with you.</font>

540
00:25:37,960 --> 00:25:40,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Lin clan is powerful locally
and very tight-knit.</font>

541
00:25:40,200 --> 00:25:42,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone must be cautious once inside.</font>

542
00:25:42,150 --> 00:25:42,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let's do this.</font>

543
00:25:42,830 --> 00:25:44,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The tax comrades will follow behind us.</font>

544
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:45,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be sure to stay safe, okay?</font>

545
00:25:46,310 --> 00:25:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move out.</font>

546
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:47,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

547
00:25:48,550 --> 00:25:49,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go. Stay behind me. Hurry.</font>

548
00:25:52,630 --> 00:25:53,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yan Ping'an.</font>

549
00:25:55,070 --> 00:25:55,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really have a gun?</font>

550
00:25:56,240 --> 00:25:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

551
00:25:56,720 --> 00:25:57,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see the gun. Just one look.</font>

552
00:25:57,960 --> 00:25:59,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No. Stay behind me.</font>

553
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:03,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you dead?</font>

554
00:27:07,200 --> 00:27:07,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay?</font>

555
00:27:11,680 --> 00:27:12,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong.</font>

556
00:27:14,590 --> 00:27:15,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong.</font>

557
00:27:24,040 --> 00:27:24,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it serious?</font>

558
00:27:25,070 --> 00:27:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's not dead.</font>

559
00:27:26,200 --> 00:27:27,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But he keeps calling Ahong.</font>

560
00:27:28,200 --> 00:27:28,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong?</font>

561
00:27:40,480 --> 00:27:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't we say no calls
unless something's wrong?</font>

562
00:27:42,590 --> 00:27:43,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you?</font>

563
00:27:44,310 --> 00:27:45,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm on my way to Linjia Village.</font>

564
00:27:46,390 --> 00:27:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something happened. Don't go.</font>

565
00:27:51,550 --> 00:27:52,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should I take care of him?</font>

566
00:27:54,760 --> 00:27:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Turn around. We're not going.</font>

567
00:28:07,480 --> 00:28:08,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

568
00:28:12,070 --> 00:28:12,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring him along.</font>

569
00:28:13,480 --> 00:28:14,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's my lucky star.</font>

570
00:28:46,790 --> 00:28:49,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right on time. Coming.</font>

571
00:28:49,480 --> 00:28:52,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye, I'm Zhang Chunlai
from the police station.</font>

572
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:53,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open the door.</font>

573
00:28:54,280 --> 00:28:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the matter?</font>

574
00:28:55,760 --> 00:28:56,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow is the ancestral ceremony.</font>

575
00:28:56,830 --> 00:28:58,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The station is doing
a safety check tonight.</font>

576
00:28:58,830 --> 00:29:00,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need to check every household.
Open up.</font>

577
00:29:02,150 --> 00:29:02,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me a moment.</font>

578
00:29:03,070 --> 00:29:04,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My wife just got out of the shower.</font>

579
00:29:04,200 --> 00:29:06,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me have her go back to the room.
Wait a moment.</font>

580
00:29:06,310 --> 00:29:06,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

581
00:29:07,390 --> 00:29:08,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there someone else in the house?</font>

582
00:29:08,830 --> 00:29:09,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

583
00:29:10,790 --> 00:29:11,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep knocking.</font>

584
00:29:12,240 --> 00:29:13,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you done, Jianye?</font>

585
00:29:15,040 --> 00:29:15,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jianye?</font>

586
00:29:16,830 --> 00:29:17,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jianye?</font>

587
00:29:23,240 --> 00:29:24,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Police! Don't move!</font>

588
00:29:25,280 --> 00:29:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhi,</font>

589
00:29:26,070 --> 00:29:27,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you two stay here.</font>

590
00:29:27,280 --> 00:29:28,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The rest of you, come with me
to check the back door.</font>

591
00:29:28,630 --> 00:29:29,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

592
00:29:35,350 --> 00:29:36,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Police! Don't move!</font>

593
00:29:48,830 --> 00:29:50,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou, are you okay?</font>

594
00:29:50,150 --> 00:29:51,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over there! Over there!</font>

595
00:29:51,630 --> 00:29:52,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it.</font>

596
00:29:56,000 --> 00:29:56,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chase!</font>

597
00:29:56,760 --> 00:29:57,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You stay here.</font>

598
00:29:58,110 --> 00:29:58,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay?</font>

599
00:29:58,830 --> 00:30:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help! Help! Save me!</font>

600
00:30:05,110 --> 00:30:05,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

601
00:30:15,960 --> 00:30:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Granduncle.</font>

602
00:30:18,200 --> 00:30:20,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Granduncle, Li Ahong is calling.</font>

603
00:30:20,830 --> 00:30:22,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This woman has some nerve.</font>

604
00:30:23,590 --> 00:30:25,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She actually reached out to me.</font>

605
00:30:25,680 --> 00:30:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She says she's still a member
of the Lin family.</font>

606
00:30:28,000 --> 00:30:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the Lin family is in trouble,
she'll step in.</font>

607
00:30:30,280 --> 00:30:32,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She wants the water even muddier.</font>

608
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, it's about Lin Jianye.</font>

609
00:30:35,520 --> 00:30:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong says something bad
is about to happen.</font>

610
00:30:50,240 --> 00:30:51,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye, stop!</font>

611
00:30:57,350 --> 00:30:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come with me. Block him up ahead!</font>

612
00:31:03,200 --> 00:31:03,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

613
00:31:03,830 --> 00:31:04,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay back!</font>

614
00:31:04,280 --> 00:31:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

615
00:31:26,630 --> 00:31:27,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Hold him down.
- Don't move!</font>

616
00:31:27,550 --> 00:31:28,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Don't move!
- Stay still!</font>

617
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:29,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Don't move!
- Stay still!</font>

618
00:31:31,520 --> 00:31:32,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go!</font>

619
00:31:32,090 --> 00:31:33,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Take him away.
- Don't move!</font>

620
00:31:33,110 --> 00:31:33,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move it!</font>

621
00:31:35,000 --> 00:31:36,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Help!
- Don't move!</font>

622
00:31:36,480 --> 00:31:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help! Save me!</font>

623
00:31:39,680 --> 00:31:40,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uncle Yuxian, save me!</font>

624
00:31:40,680 --> 00:31:41,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- What are you doing?
- Don't move!</font>

625
00:31:42,390 --> 00:31:44,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Don't move!
- Calm down!</font>

626
00:31:44,350 --> 00:31:46,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Most people in Linjia Village
know martial arts.</font>

627
00:31:46,310 --> 00:31:47,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's best to avoid a confrontation.</font>

628
00:31:49,110 --> 00:31:49,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fellow villagers,</font>

629
00:31:50,200 --> 00:31:51,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're from the city criminal police.</font>

630
00:31:51,790 --> 00:31:53,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need to take Lin Jianye back</font>

631
00:31:54,000 --> 00:31:55,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to ask him some questions.</font>

632
00:31:55,630 --> 00:31:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We hope you'll cooperate.</font>

633
00:31:57,310 --> 00:31:58,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Zhang Chunlai
from the police station.</font>

634
00:31:59,440 --> 00:32:00,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think you all know me.</font>

635
00:32:01,150 --> 00:32:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I advise you not to act rashly.</font>

636
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:04,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't cause trouble.</font>

637
00:32:04,040 --> 00:32:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uncle Yuxian, save me!</font>

638
00:32:05,440 --> 00:32:06,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut your mouth!</font>

639
00:32:06,680 --> 00:32:07,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What crime did he commit?</font>

640
00:32:11,040 --> 00:32:12,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He made and sold fake invoices.</font>

641
00:32:12,920 --> 00:32:13,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of crime is that?</font>

642
00:32:14,150 --> 00:32:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Release him!</font>

643
00:32:14,870 --> 00:32:19,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Release him! Release him!</font>

644
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:21,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Stop shouting!
- Quiet!</font>

645
00:32:21,150 --> 00:32:21,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quiet!</font>

646
00:32:22,920 --> 00:32:25,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye, you broke the law alone,</font>

647
00:32:25,350 --> 00:32:27,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you made the whole village
resist the law with you.</font>

648
00:32:27,280 --> 00:32:28,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of hero are you?</font>

649
00:32:28,390 --> 00:32:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Release him! Release him!</font>

650
00:32:29,720 --> 00:32:30,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop shouting!</font>

651
00:32:30,520 --> 00:32:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Release him! Release him!</font>

652
00:32:31,960 --> 00:32:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't gather a crowd to cause trouble.</font>

653
00:32:32,960 --> 00:32:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let the person in charge come out.</font>

654
00:32:34,920 --> 00:32:37,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Zhang, have you forgotten?</font>

655
00:32:37,350 --> 00:32:38,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am the person in charge.</font>

656
00:32:39,240 --> 00:32:41,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These days,
we're holding ancestral rites.</font>

657
00:32:42,000 --> 00:32:43,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Worshiping the ancestors</font>

658
00:32:43,200 --> 00:32:44,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a major event for Linjia Village,</font>

659
00:32:44,240 --> 00:32:46,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with over a thousand people every year.</font>

660
00:32:47,110 --> 00:32:48,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet you came to arrest him now.</font>

661
00:32:48,870 --> 00:32:50,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that slapping us in the face?</font>

662
00:32:50,590 --> 00:32:51,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uncle Yuxian.</font>

663
00:32:51,920 --> 00:32:53,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You good-for-nothing,</font>

664
00:32:53,790 --> 00:32:55,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've delayed
the clan's important event.</font>

665
00:32:55,550 --> 00:32:58,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">According to clan rules,
those who cannot worship due to crimes</font>

666
00:32:58,760 --> 00:33:00,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">shall receive thirty lashes.</font>

667
00:33:00,680 --> 00:33:01,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jianye,</font>

668
00:33:01,760 --> 00:33:04,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">go receive your punishment
in the ancestral hall right now.</font>

669
00:33:05,440 --> 00:33:06,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He can't go anywhere right now.</font>

670
00:33:07,310 --> 00:33:08,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ancestral rites are important,</font>

671
00:33:08,720 --> 00:33:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but they don't outweigh national law.</font>

672
00:33:10,310 --> 00:33:12,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your rules for a thousand people</font>

673
00:33:13,000 --> 00:33:14,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't outweigh the rules
for over a billion people nationwide.</font>

674
00:33:15,630 --> 00:33:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you hear?</font>

675
00:33:17,000 --> 00:33:18,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take Jianye to the ancestral hall.</font>

676
00:33:19,790 --> 00:33:20,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't do anything rash.</font>

677
00:33:20,350 --> 00:33:21,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Step back!
- All of you, step back!</font>

678
00:33:21,790 --> 00:33:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Don't move!
- Step back!</font>

679
00:33:23,390 --> 00:33:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Step back!</font>

680
00:33:25,110 --> 00:33:27,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't move. I'll say it again.</font>

681
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:29,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please cooperate with our work.</font>

682
00:33:30,240 --> 00:33:32,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Make way!
- Move aside!</font>

683
00:33:32,830 --> 00:33:33,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back!</font>

684
00:33:33,590 --> 00:33:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Move aside!
- Step back!</font>

685
00:33:35,240 --> 00:33:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move aside!</font>

686
00:33:37,960 --> 00:33:38,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Step back!</font>

687
00:33:41,000 --> 00:33:41,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

688
00:33:41,830 --> 00:33:42,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uncle Yuxian.</font>

689
00:33:42,350 --> 00:33:42,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Step back!</font>

690
00:33:42,870 --> 00:33:43,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't come any closer!</font>

691
00:33:49,480 --> 00:33:50,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Step back!</font>

692
00:33:54,870 --> 00:33:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back up, step back!</font>

693
00:33:56,480 --> 00:33:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is assaulting an officer!</font>

694
00:33:58,110 --> 00:33:58,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back up!</font>

695
00:34:01,830 --> 00:34:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

696
00:34:02,460 --> 00:34:03,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Lin Clan's Ancestral Hall]</font>

697
00:34:04,110 --> 00:34:04,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye.</font>

698
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:07,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye.</font>

699
00:34:11,040 --> 00:34:11,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye.</font>

700
00:34:15,110 --> 00:34:15,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't move.</font>

701
00:34:21,150 --> 00:34:22,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye, what are you doing?</font>

702
00:34:23,150 --> 00:34:25,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you crazy? Those are your ancestors.</font>

703
00:34:28,680 --> 00:34:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Lin Clan's Ancestral Hall]</font>

704
00:34:29,440 --> 00:34:30,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

705
00:34:30,520 --> 00:34:31,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The police have gone too far.</font>

706
00:34:32,110 --> 00:34:33,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They smashed our ancestors' tablets.</font>

707
00:34:36,590 --> 00:34:38,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Don't move.
- Stay still.</font>

708
00:34:38,550 --> 00:34:39,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Stay still.
- Granduncle.</font>

709
00:34:39,360 --> 00:34:40,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Don't move.
- They smashed the ancestral hall.</font>

710
00:34:42,190 --> 00:34:42,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me.</font>

711
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring him in.</font>

712
00:34:49,190 --> 00:34:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

713
00:34:50,520 --> 00:34:51,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

714
00:34:53,360 --> 00:34:54,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

715
00:34:54,520 --> 00:34:54,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

716
00:34:55,190 --> 00:34:56,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We didn't do it.</font>

717
00:34:56,590 --> 00:34:58,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, don't do anything rash.</font>

718
00:35:18,840 --> 00:35:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know the consequences
of what you're doing?</font>

719
00:35:23,840 --> 00:35:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang Xu! Ouyang Xu!</font>

720
00:35:25,440 --> 00:35:26,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My asthma</font>

721
00:35:26,590 --> 00:35:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is acting up.</font>

722
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:27,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang Xu.</font>

723
00:35:28,320 --> 00:35:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The medicine.</font>

724
00:35:28,960 --> 00:35:30,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me the medicine on the table.</font>

725
00:35:30,360 --> 00:35:32,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His asthma is acting up.
It could kill him.</font>

726
00:35:32,400 --> 00:35:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me the medicine.</font>

727
00:35:34,590 --> 00:35:37,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Lin family also respects the law.</font>

728
00:35:37,960 --> 00:35:39,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We won't make trouble
for you two leaders.</font>

729
00:35:40,070 --> 00:35:42,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you turned
the ancestral hall into this,</font>

730
00:35:42,630 --> 00:35:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">disturbing the ancestors.</font>

731
00:35:44,800 --> 00:35:47,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must give us an explanation.</font>

732
00:35:47,800 --> 00:35:49,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We didn't make
the ancestral hall like this.</font>

733
00:35:49,550 --> 00:35:50,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll give you an explanation.</font>

734
00:35:50,800 --> 00:35:51,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me the medicine.</font>

735
00:35:51,590 --> 00:35:53,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me the medicine first!</font>

736
00:35:53,710 --> 00:35:54,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give it to me!</font>

737
00:35:55,520 --> 00:35:57,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Apologize to the Lin ancestors,</font>

738
00:35:59,320 --> 00:36:00,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the medicine is his.</font>

739
00:36:03,110 --> 00:36:03,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move aside.</font>

740
00:36:04,550 --> 00:36:05,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me do it.</font>

741
00:36:06,070 --> 00:36:06,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me do it!</font>

742
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:07,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move aside!</font>

743
00:36:08,320 --> 00:36:09,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, we have a deal.</font>

744
00:36:09,590 --> 00:36:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't go back on your word.</font>

745
00:36:10,800 --> 00:36:11,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me the medicine.</font>

746
00:36:15,710 --> 00:36:17,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We let you print invoices,</font>

747
00:36:17,590 --> 00:36:18,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you sold them privately</font>

748
00:36:19,440 --> 00:36:21,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and colluded with Li Ahong, an outsider,</font>

749
00:36:21,710 --> 00:36:22,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">betraying the clan's interests.</font>

750
00:36:23,670 --> 00:36:25,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any one of these
could cost you your life.</font>

751
00:36:25,800 --> 00:36:26,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not like that.</font>

752
00:36:26,440 --> 00:36:27,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have to believe I'm innocent.</font>

753
00:36:27,750 --> 00:36:28,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cut the crap.</font>

754
00:36:29,230 --> 00:36:30,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, I'm giving you a chance to atone.</font>

755
00:36:31,400 --> 00:36:32,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">According to clan rules.</font>

756
00:36:32,750 --> 00:36:34,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll support your family.
You take the blame.</font>

757
00:36:38,040 --> 00:36:39,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your family will want for nothing.</font>

758
00:36:40,040 --> 00:36:42,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll get paid the moment you're out.</font>

759
00:36:51,880 --> 00:36:53,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Lins keep their word.</font>

760
00:36:54,400 --> 00:36:55,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can leave now.</font>

761
00:37:02,270 --> 00:37:03,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

762
00:37:04,230 --> 00:37:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we respected your rules.</font>

763
00:37:06,710 --> 00:37:08,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, it's our turn.</font>

764
00:37:08,550 --> 00:37:10,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye is a suspect.</font>

765
00:37:11,360 --> 00:37:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must take him today.</font>

766
00:37:14,750 --> 00:37:17,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really don't know
what's good for you.</font>

767
00:37:18,190 --> 00:37:20,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you delay our ancestral rites,</font>

768
00:37:21,000 --> 00:37:22,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can you bear the responsibility?</font>

769
00:37:22,590 --> 00:37:23,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you obstruct national law,</font>

770
00:37:24,190 --> 00:37:25,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can't bear
that responsibility either.</font>

771
00:37:27,110 --> 00:37:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You stormed into my ancestral hall</font>

772
00:37:29,480 --> 00:37:30,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and tried to arrest my clansman.</font>

773
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:33,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I let you take him away,</font>

774
00:37:34,040 --> 00:37:36,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't answer to the clan.</font>

775
00:37:40,320 --> 00:37:41,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

776
00:37:41,800 --> 00:37:42,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">today, this man</font>

777
00:37:43,150 --> 00:37:44,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must leave with us.</font>

778
00:37:44,520 --> 00:37:46,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I advise you not to hesitate.</font>

779
00:37:47,230 --> 00:37:49,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This chance will only come once.</font>

780
00:37:50,440 --> 00:37:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uncle Yuxian, is this your call?</font>

781
00:38:03,070 --> 00:38:04,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Lin clan's precept:</font>

782
00:38:05,440 --> 00:38:06,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mean what you say.</font>

783
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:07,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do what you mean.</font>

784
00:38:19,230 --> 00:38:20,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye,</font>

785
00:38:20,480 --> 00:38:24,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from now on, you alone</font>

786
00:38:25,520 --> 00:38:27,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will bear the guilt.</font>

787
00:38:28,840 --> 00:38:30,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one else in the clan is involved.</font>

788
00:38:32,110 --> 00:38:33,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you accept or not?</font>

789
00:38:36,320 --> 00:38:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I accept.</font>

790
00:38:42,150 --> 00:38:42,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well?</font>

791
00:38:42,750 --> 00:38:43,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Luo.</font>

792
00:38:44,750 --> 00:38:45,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's another way.</font>

793
00:38:46,440 --> 00:38:49,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After our ancestral rites end,</font>

794
00:38:49,960 --> 00:38:52,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will hand Lin Jianye over to you.</font>

795
00:38:53,360 --> 00:38:54,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't agree to that.</font>

796
00:38:54,710 --> 00:38:56,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if we die</font>

797
00:38:56,550 --> 00:38:57,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right here today,</font>

798
00:38:58,750 --> 00:38:59,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we will still take him away.</font>

799
00:39:06,000 --> 00:39:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move aside.</font>

800
00:39:13,480 --> 00:39:14,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Granduncle.</font>

801
00:39:18,230 --> 00:39:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can hand Lin Jianye over to you,</font>

802
00:39:21,360 --> 00:39:22,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but it must follow our clan rules.</font>

803
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:24,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you accept them or not?</font>

804
00:39:24,440 --> 00:39:25,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't accept your clan rules.</font>

805
00:39:28,750 --> 00:39:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We accept.</font>

806
00:39:30,190 --> 00:39:31,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, we accept.</font>

807
00:39:31,880 --> 00:39:32,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll follow your clan rules,</font>

808
00:39:33,320 --> 00:39:34,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as long as you hand him over.</font>

809
00:39:36,150 --> 00:39:36,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good.</font>

810
00:39:37,880 --> 00:39:39,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You agreed to this yourselves.</font>

811
00:39:40,110 --> 00:39:40,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

812
00:39:42,040 --> 00:39:42,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yuxian.</font>

813
00:39:59,360 --> 00:39:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay?</font>

814
00:40:00,110 --> 00:40:00,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

815
00:40:01,270 --> 00:40:02,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mission accomplished.</font>

816
00:40:02,040 --> 00:40:02,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We got him out.</font>

817
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get in the car first.</font>

818
00:40:06,520 --> 00:40:07,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

819
00:40:14,880 --> 00:40:15,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you hurt?</font>

820
00:40:15,840 --> 00:40:16,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine, Master.</font>

821
00:40:16,920 --> 00:40:18,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've brought Lin Jianye back.</font>

822
00:40:18,040 --> 00:40:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mission accomplished.</font>

823
00:40:20,800 --> 00:40:21,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's talk later.</font>

824
00:40:21,670 --> 00:40:22,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

825
00:41:10,550 --> 00:41:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lift your leg!</font>

826
00:41:11,590 --> 00:41:12,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't I teach you last time?</font>

827
00:41:20,670 --> 00:41:22,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't Jian fix it that day?</font>

828
00:41:22,710 --> 00:41:24,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get a professional to repair it.</font>

829
00:41:24,800 --> 00:41:25,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

830
00:41:31,630 --> 00:41:32,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's news.</font>

831
00:41:33,440 --> 00:41:34,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye has been arrested.</font>

832
00:41:34,840 --> 00:41:36,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Second Granduncle and Lin Yuxian
were punished severely</font>

833
00:41:36,960 --> 00:41:37,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for obstructing law enforcement.</font>

834
00:41:38,230 --> 00:41:39,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good thing</font>

835
00:41:39,190 --> 00:41:40,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we didn't go that day.</font>

836
00:41:40,440 --> 00:41:43,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After these busy days, pick a good day.</font>

837
00:41:43,750 --> 00:41:44,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll go thank the deities.</font>

838
00:41:46,800 --> 00:41:47,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way,</font>

839
00:41:47,880 --> 00:41:48,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about the person that day,</font>

840
00:41:49,590 --> 00:41:51,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everything on him wasn't worth
even a few dozen yuan.</font>

841
00:41:52,480 --> 00:41:53,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was flat broke.</font>

842
00:41:54,150 --> 00:41:55,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you think</font>

843
00:41:56,000 --> 00:41:57,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he knew my name?</font>

844
00:42:00,440 --> 00:42:01,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's probably just the same name.</font>

845
00:42:02,670 --> 00:42:03,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then it's fate.</font>

846
00:42:05,670 --> 00:42:06,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What else was in his bag?</font>

847
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:09,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fate, huh?</font>

848
00:42:10,110 --> 00:42:10,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His papers.</font>

849
00:42:13,270 --> 00:42:15,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zhou Haiyang]
From Dongyu. There's also a work ID.</font>

850
00:42:16,400 --> 00:42:17,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jiarong People's Printing Factory]
He works in printing.</font>

851
00:42:17,960 --> 00:42:20,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now this is what you call fate.</font>

852
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:23,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to see him.</font>

853
00:42:29,230 --> 00:42:29,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

854
00:42:33,220 --> 00:42:45,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪My lovely Amarilli♪</font>

855
00:42:46,840 --> 00:42:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I'm leaving. Don't look for me.
Jiang Xiaohong]</font>

856
00:42:56,230 --> 00:42:58,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're awake? Ahong wants to see you.</font>

857
00:43:31,190 --> 00:43:33,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Why do you need to hide♪</font>

858
00:43:33,310 --> 00:43:35,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪So♪</font>

859
00:43:35,280 --> 00:43:37,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Ordinary and simple♪</font>

860
00:43:38,310 --> 00:43:42,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I dare not look back on those days♪</font>

861
00:43:42,390 --> 00:43:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Clinging to broken wholeness♪</font>

862
00:43:46,010 --> 00:43:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The strength of worrying
about gain and loss♪</font>

863
00:43:49,080 --> 00:43:51,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Breaking means courage♪</font>

864
00:43:52,680 --> 00:43:56,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The ambitious young man♪</font>

865
00:43:56,690 --> 00:43:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Accompanied by loneliness♪</font>

866
00:43:59,590 --> 00:44:02,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Breaking through the tracks of time♪</font>

867
00:44:03,220 --> 00:44:06,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The remnants of dreams are uproaring♪</font>

868
00:44:07,120 --> 00:44:10,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At my lowest moments, I always look up♪</font>

869
00:44:11,020 --> 00:44:14,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more begging♪</font>

870
00:44:14,560 --> 00:44:20,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Wind is in my arms; the time is right♪</font>

871
00:44:21,370 --> 00:44:25,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Those years remain spotless
in my heart♪</font>

872
00:44:25,270 --> 00:44:27,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No one knows♪</font>

873
00:44:27,970 --> 00:44:31,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Set out♪</font>

874
00:44:31,150 --> 00:44:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Take off all the armor♪</font>

875
00:44:35,610 --> 00:44:37,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more regret♪</font>

876
00:44:37,500 --> 00:44:39,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more complaining♪</font>

877
00:44:39,350 --> 00:44:43,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more begging for mercy
in humiliation♪</font>

878
00:44:43,440 --> 00:44:49,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Wind is in my arms; the time is right♪</font>

879
00:44:49,940 --> 00:44:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Those years remain spotless
in my heart♪</font>

880
00:44:53,980 --> 00:44:56,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No one knows♪</font>

881
00:44:56,660 --> 00:44:59,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Set out♪</font>

882
00:44:59,820 --> 00:45:02,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Even if I fall again♪</font>

883
00:45:03,910 --> 00:45:05,670
